Poincare.D7.Canonical.EpsilonApproximation.toGHConvergenceData_ofGHConvergenceData.{u} {X : ℕ → PointedMetricSpace}
  {Y : PointedMetricSpace} (D : GHConvergenceData Filter.atTop X Y) :
  (EpsilonApproximation.toGHConvergenceData D.ε ⋯ ⋯ fun n => EpsilonApproximation.ofGHConvergenceData D n) = D
